			"notes": "Huge thanks to @Seigmannen for most of the update, and allowing [his datapack ](https://github.com/Seigmannen/CarpetSkyAdditions-Datapack) to be merged in.\n\n- Added Happy Ghast to \"spyglass at all animals\" advancement\n- Added tall dry grass and firefly bush to \"all wandering trader trades\" advancement\n- Changed bush progress to \"dead bush\"\n- Bolt & Flow armor trim challenges\n- Trial chamber music disks  (Skeletons killing creepers in trial chambers' bounding boxes now has a chance to drop two of the music disks related to trial chambers.)\n- Trial chamber music disk advancement \n- Updated loot table for trial vaults to nerf them to not break progression\n- More Mob Heads datapack\n- No Tree start datapack\n- New datapack icons\n- Fix vaults having incorrect config\n- Fix client side crash https://github.com/TreeOfSelf/CarpetSkyAdditions-Reborn/issues/76\n- Fixed Trial Spawners / Vaults spawning with broken data .... again... (Use mcaselector commands in mod description to remove broken ones)"
